254
00:14:42,900 --> 00:14:45,980
Ya. Dengan acar,
dan tolong tekan rata.

255
00:14:45,980 --> 00:14:46,620
Terima kasih.

256
00:14:46,620 --> 00:14:47,700
Beres, bos.

257
00:14:48,220 --> 00:14:49,260
