Hei.

282
00:17:07,980 --> 00:17:10,560
Kau manusia laba-laba
yang ada di Youtube, 'kan?

283
00:17:10,600 --> 00:17:11,780
Panggil aku Spider-Man!

284
00:17:11,780 --> 00:17:14,740
Baiklah, Spider-Man.
Lakukan salto!

285
00:17:15,380 --> 00:17:18,180
Yeah!/
Lumayan.

286
00:17:30,740 --> 00:17:31,540
Hei, bung.

287
00:17:33,580 --> 00:17:36,180
Jangan mencuri mobil, tidak baik!/
Ini mobilku, bodoh!

288
00:17:36,220 --> 00:17:37,940
Hei! Matikan itu!

289
00:17:38,140 --> 00:17:39,580
Beritahu dia kalau ini mobilku!

290
