Kukira kau lebih tampan.

324
00:19:39,460 --> 00:19:41,540
Iron-Man! Kenapa merampok bank?

325
00:19:41,540 --> 00:19:42,860
Kau seorang miliarder!

326
00:19:47,260 --> 00:19:49,300
