409
00:24:23,260 --> 00:24:24,820
Kukira kau suka larb.

410
00:24:25,450 --> 00:24:26,500
Apa terlalu larb?

411
00:24:27,410 --> 00:24:29,340
Tidak cukup larb?

412
00:24:30,210 --> 00:24:34,860
