413
00:24:35,020 --> 00:24:36,540
Kau tahu aku menyayangimu.

414
00:24:37,020 --> 00:24:40,260
Aku hanya stres dan
lelah karena magang.

415
00:24:40,500 --> 00:24:41,580
Dan banyak pekerjaan.

416
00:24:41,580 --> 00:24:43,420
Magang Stark?

417
00:24:43,880 --> 00:24:45,460
Jujur saja...

418
00:24:45,910 --> 00:24:47,940
Aku tak begitu suka Tony Stark.

419
00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:50,500
Dia membuatmu tidak fokus.

420
00:24:50,910 --> 00:24:52,420
Dan memenuhi pikiranmu.

421
00:24:52,420 --> 00:24:55,060
<i>Berita lokal: Roti Lapis Delmar
yang digemari warga Queens...</i>

422
00:24:55,060 --> 00:24:57,620
