429
00:25:16,050 --> 00:25:18,100
Ya. Tentu saja.

430
00:25:18,100 --> 00:25:19,740
Enam blok dari tempat kita.

431
00:25:19,940 --> 00:25:21,740
Aku butuh ransel baru.

432
00:25:22,900 --> 00:25:23,820
Apa?

433
00:25:23,980 --> 00:25:25,500
Aku butuh ransel baru.

434
00:25:25,840 --> 00:25:27,180
