438
00:25:32,680 --> 00:25:34,620
Oh. Terima kasih.

439
00:25:36,250 --> 00:25:38,020
Dia baik sekali.

440
00:25:39,180 --> 00:25:40,940
Kurasa dia menyukaimu.

441
00:25:42,980 --> 00:25:44,580
