Masuklah. Ayo.

1434
01:28:00,420 --> 01:28:01,540
Hai, Peter.

1435
01:28:02,580 --> 01:28:04,860
Kau tampan sekali./
Terima kasih.

1436
01:28:06,000 --> 01:28:07,540
Kau ingat namanya, 'kan?

1437
01:28:08,300 --> 01:28:09,720
Freddie?/
Peter.

1438
01:28:09,820 --> 01:28:11,140
Peter. Peter.

1439
01:28:12,120 --> 01:28:13,300
Akan kupanggilkan Liz.

1440
01:28:13,330 --> 01:28:14,800
Baik.

1441
01:28:21,020 --> 01:28:23,460
Kau tak apa, Pete?/
Ya.

1442
01:28:23,860 --> 01:28:25,220
Karena kau tampak...

1443
01:28:25,220 --> 01:28:26,180
...pucat.

1444
01:28:28,070 --> 01:28:32,020
Mau minum bourbon, Scotch,
atau semacamnya?

1445
01:28:32,140 --> 01:28:33,540
Aku belum cukup usia
untuk alkohol.

1446
01:28:33,940 --> 01:28:35,350
Jawabanmu tepat.

1447
01:28:37,440 --> 01:28:38,470
Wah.

1448
01:28:38,940 --> 01:28:40,900
Kau cantik sekali.

1449
01:28:41,060 --> 01:28:42,460
Jangan buat aku malu, Ayah.

1450
01:28:42,730 --> 01:28:43,940
Dia cantik, Pete?

1451
01:28:44,100 --> 01:28:46,380
Ya, kau sangat cantik.

1452
01:28:46,980 --> 01:28:48,940
Sekali lagi, jawabanmu tepat.

1453
01:28:49,130 --> 01:28:50,530
Itu korsase?

1454
01:28:52,920 --> 01:28:54,330
Terima kasih.

1455
01:28:54,660 --> 01:28:56,740
Aku yang akan mengantar kalian.

1456
01:28:56,860 --> 01:28:58,350
Jadi ayo berangkat.

1457
01:28:58,360 --> 01:29:00,300
Tidak. Kita harus berfoto dulu, sayang.

1458
01:29:01,540 --> 01:29:02,540
Di sini.

1459
01:29:02,540 --> 01:29:03,580
Sempurna.

1460
01:29:04,260 --> 01:29:05,540
Ayo.

1461
01:29:06,090 --> 01:29:07,330
Peter, mendekat.

1462
01:29:09,510 --> 01:29:10,600
Senyum!

1463
01:29:11,820 --> 01:29:12,540
Ini dia.

1464
01:29:19,220 --> 01:29:20,980
Pak, kau tak perlu mengantar kami.

1465
01:29:21,100 --> 01:29:22,420
Tidak masalah.

1466
01:29:22,760 --> 01:29:24,850
Aku mau ke luar kota.
Kebetulan lewat sekolah.

1467
01:29:24,850 --> 01:29:27,100
Dia selalu bepergian./
Ini yang terakhir, sayang.

1468
01:29:27,620 --> 01:29:28,420
Aku janji.

1469
01:29:28,620 --> 01:29:29,700
Dia tampan.

1470
01:29:31,770 --> 01:29:33,700
Sampai jumpa dua hari lagi./
Dah, sayang.

1471
01:29:34,700 --> 01:29:35,940
Ayo, Pedro.

1472
01:29:36,460 --> 01:29:38,540
Dah, Peter, bersenang-senanglah./
Ya. Tentu.

1473
01:29:48,820 --> 01:29:50,180
Apa rencanamu, Pete?

1474
01:29:50,820 --> 01:29:51,610
Apa?

1475
01:29:51,780 --> 01:29:53,540
Setelah lulus, apa rencanamu?

1476
01:29:53,740 --> 01:29:55,260
Oh, entahlah.

1477
01:29:55,470 --> 01:29:56,620
Jangan interogasi dia, Ayah.

1478
01:29:57,140 --> 01:29:58,180
Hanya berpendapat...

1479
